  "published": "2026-11-06T08:18:00.853Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Rework of CWL handling and RO-Crate conversion to support CWL 1.2 and 1.3 features #654\nVarious small fixes, including RO-Crate and XLSX parsing #653\nAdditions:\nRewrite references in record values when the ids of data entities are normalized\nTake CWL defaults into the crate of the ARC as well\nLink the files a workflow or run needs in the crate of the ARC as well\nWrite a run value that names the ARC root as a reference to the crate root\nLeave the CWL of workflows and runs empty when reading a crate\nMake the type rule of run values public as CWLType.admits\nConvert the dates of composed workflows and runs to UTC\nTake CWL defaults only into the run crate and for null run values\nKeep a run out of its own parts when a run value names its folder\nKeep the types of both nodes when a graph merges nodes of one id\nList files in lists and records of run values in the root of the crate\nWrite crate dates in UTC and pin them with one timestamp\nCheck run values against the types of their inputs again\nUse the CWL default of an input without a run value\nWrite directory values of runs as datasets with their files\nReport the JavaScript speed tests as JavaScript and write the Python report in UTF-8\nUpdate Fable to 5.26.0\nAdd CWL decode and encode to the speed tests\nMerge origin/main into cwl_yamlicious_2\nAdd multiple alternative constructors to DU types. Mirror native js tests to native python\nupdate tests further with correct imports from index and more helpers\nAdd primary constructor tests for js native\nPublish crate roots at the local time when no date is given\nWalk steps only in a mapping whose class is workflow\nLeave out a directory literal that names the arc root explicitly\nRead the run folder itself back as a dot\nCheck referenced and part paths for duplicates with hash sets\nRead every crate id with a uri scheme as a url and not as a file of the arc\nKeep URLs in job files and compare run folders by segments\nList the files that CWL file and directory literals name\nPublish crate roots with a date and their profiles as entities\nWrite step runs as paths from the crate root\nList the files a workflow needs in its crate\nResolve dot segments in job file paths\nRestructure the CWL tests as shared tables\nDrop packed documents and stop on cyclic runs\nRead type names and step outputs without validating them\nUpdate Fable to 5.24\nApply the repeated-key rule to every mapping\nMake the step id optional and quote YAML 1.1 lookalikes\nimprove speed of identifier validation by creating the regex only once (#303)\nReject prohibited YAML features and report error locations\nmake SetAssay, SetStudy, SetWorkflow and SetRun add the entity if no entity with the identifier exists (#565)\nRead directives and numbers in scalar fields like cwltool\nRead Schema Salad directives\nDecode every string field strictly\nKeep run references and job files of an ARC\nReport decode errors with path and span\nWrite port schemas under type and drop the Dirent type\nRead packed documents and SchemaDefRequirement types\nadd full arc ro-crate roundtrip test (#651)\nRead the type Any, input formats and stream types\nnormalize ro-crate file and dataset ids to leading ./ on write and read (#615, #607)\nadd warning for empty study, assay, run and workflow titles in ro-crate export (#613)\nBugfixes:\nfix semver comparison not following the spec and parsing failing for versions without minor or patch (#639)\nfix ms, po and ro term accessions being written as ols urls instead of obo purls (#551, #391)\nfix empty data file paths being resolved to assay and study folders (#593)\nfix external files being added to filesystem when reading ro-crate (#650)\nfix assay registrations of studies being lost in ro-crate (#651)\nfix workflow datamap not being written to ro-crate (#651)\nfix datamap fields not being read from compacted ro-crate (#651)\nfix cwl input file paths of runs not being read with normalized ro-crate ids (#615)\nfix empty input and output cells resulting in ro-crate entities (#585)\nfix ro-crate citations using local identifiers instead of doi or pubmed urls (#627)\nupdate exceljs to 0.5.0 to fix reading tables with totals row formulas (#508)",
